                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f81accd4-1fbb-3edb-a0a0-13e52b3faee9",
                        "entry_id": "347213d9-3a5d-3eca-8742-e42268d96f18",
                        "glosses": [
                            "крупный магазин самообслуживания, торгующий продовольственными товарами и хозяйственно-бытовыми предметами повседневного спроса"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "54d6930f-0b2e-455a-909d-815875a54666",
                                "sense_id": "f81accd4-1fbb-3edb-a0a0-13e52b3faee9",
                                "text": "Москва далеко, и магазин, как это у вас там ― бери сам, чего хочешь, или универсам, неблизко, а еду трудно сделалось добывать, дальше и того трудней будет."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9bcfd38a-d08e-4cdb-903d-b9b2e4cf94e9",
                                "sense_id": "f81accd4-1fbb-3edb-a0a0-13e52b3faee9",
                                "text": "Купил в универсаме два пакета гнилой картошки ― весной дело было, под пасху."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ca65c75c-a2e4-492d-96c9-9e05e45feb20",
                                "sense_id": "f81accd4-1fbb-3edb-a0a0-13e52b3faee9",
                                "text": "Универсамы вытесняют мелкого торговца с его лавкой, где сыпучий товар насыпают совком, где крутят бумажные фунтики, где продавец и его постоянные покупатели знают друг друга издавна, где, в конце концов, можно взять в долг до получки."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "324dc860-3b99-4f13-a240-eeef8984b97f",
                        "source_entry_id": "347213d9-3a5d-3eca-8742-e42268d96f18",
                        "source_sense_id": "f81accd4-1fbb-3edb-a0a0-13e52b3faee9",
                        "target_lang_word": "supermarket",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "supermarket",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a3c5d8e1-e6e9-3c1b-b6da-7bb9acc666ef",
                                        "entry_id": "17a75b69-302e-3d84-863f-4bd8f492e0ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A large self-service store that sells groceries and, usually, medications, household goods, and/or clothing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5c3cb816-1943-4fdb-9475-53128d1a821c",
                                                "sense_id": "a3c5d8e1-e6e9-3c1b-b6da-7bb9acc666ef",
                                                "text": "I went to the supermarket to buy some food."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a4dcdc3-87d9-445f-a4f8-57ee048f04fb",
                                                "sense_id": "a3c5d8e1-e6e9-3c1b-b6da-7bb9acc666ef",
                                                "text": "Cans of Coca-Cola Original Taste, Coca-Cola Zero Sugar, Diet Coke, and Sprite Zero sent to cafes and restaurants are being withdrawn as well as 6x250ml Appletiser multipacks sent to UK supermarkets."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "46a4901a-3166-3d0e-9c94-2f09dc439d98",
                                        "entry_id": "17a75b69-302e-3d84-863f-4bd8f492e0ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A chain of such stores."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "05e16372-2396-31a7-bb12-a8174da06368",
                                        "entry_id": "17a75b69-302e-3d84-863f-4bd8f492e0ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A one-stop shop; a place offering a range of products or services."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "665411f1-db7b-4196-8d3a-afd0d16518f3",
                                                "sense_id": "05e16372-2396-31a7-bb12-a8174da06368",
                                                "text": "If you know what you want by filtering down the 1,600 or so trusts to a short list and then studying the information on each via online sources, then you can buy your trust and get all or nearly all of the commission back into your bank account via an Internet investment supermarket. Here, you select your fund, decide whether you want it as an Individual Savings Account (ISA), and pay for it with a credit card."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1c582816-4705-4da1-932c-c2f1b194f933",
                                                "sense_id": "05e16372-2396-31a7-bb12-a8174da06368",
                                                "text": "Almina grew up in the age of the internet and the infinite supermarket of pornography it provides."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
